	"Description": "[size=4][b]This mod adds 7 new machines to create a variety of new artisan goods.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]The 7 Machines:[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Caramel Machine - Caramels[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Cupcake Machine - Cupcakes[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Ganache Machine - Ganache[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Licorice Maker - Licorice[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Rock Candy Maker - Rock Candy[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Soda Mixer - Sodas[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Taffy Roller - Taffy[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Most can either be purchased directly from Gus (the majority starting Y2), and some recipes can also be purchased from him.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Needs ProducerFrameworkMod and JsonAssets[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />Shout out to Artisan Valley, which is where I learned how to make machines by looking at the code.\n<br />",
